; Website: https://tilde.town/~kasasagi/
; Downloads: https://drive.proton.me/urls/PDERG8YN00#RwM3MVN730fv

;========================================================
;
; A dead cherry tree in a japanese courtyard.
;
;
; Sokaku Mochizuki's stage from the game Real Bout Fatal Fury 2 by SNK-Playmore.
;
; M.U.G.E.N. adaptation by R.o.q.u.e.
;
; Special thanks to :
;  - SNK-Playmore for the Real Bout series
;  - ElSemi, for Nebula
;  - Corel, for Paint Shop Pro
;  - Sés, for M.C.M.
;  - Christophe and Winane, for SFFExtract
;  - Elecbyte, for Sprmaker
;
; For more M.U.G.E.N. material, visit the website : http://alice-games.org
;
; Notes : In the original game, there are two versions of this stage : one with hardly any rain and
; another with a downpour. This stage is the second version.
;
;========================================================

;--------------------------------------------------------

[Info]
